    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "On 10,11 November 2023, Samudai DAO's multisig and founder wallets were compromised on Ethereum, resulting in theft of over $1.25M in ETH and USDC. The proceeds were laundered via Tornado Cash, and a public on-chain bounty offer was made for recovery, but no funds returned. The root cause was the compromise of private keys controlling the Samudai DAO treasury multisig and the founder's wallet, enabling unauthorized transfers by the attacker."
